		{
			dependencies: ["0DF21CEDCCD62DAC"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>第一阶</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在溶解室中：两个塑料、一个 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>Pity框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、两个下界砖、两个铁锭和一个 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>金齿轮</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，放置在 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>250乳胶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每秒十五帧。这是你第一次将生乳胶直接倒入机器而非固化，所以请备一个储罐。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 简易框架围住了植物农场、激光钻、发酵站、生物探测器以及四台发电机。"
			]
