			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.6>简易机械框架</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 12.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0DF21CEDCCD62DAC"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>四种升级方式</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个附加包都是一个基于红石、玻璃板和一对齿轮的溶解室配方，放置在</grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>1000 latex</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中。金齿轮制作一级版本，钻石齿轮制作二级版本。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>速度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>能让机器更快地完成工作。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>效率</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使其消耗更少的能量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>处理中</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使其每周期完成更多操作。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>范围</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会扩大其工作区域。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 附加组件可叠加。速度为2、处理量为2的机器，其工作量是普通机器的九倍。"
			]
