				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和速度附魔的形状一样，但用</grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>两根烈焰棒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>代替了糖。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>黄金齿轮版将功耗降至</grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>90%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。钻石齿轮版则降至</grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>80%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>单独来看节省不大。但它能让速度类模组不再拖后腿。</grad></shadow>"
			]
