		{
			dependencies: ["4655F27F7B8EDEA1"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三种类型，一个方块</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这三种配方都包含红石粉、末影珍珠和怜悯框架，中间的配料决定了最终产物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.8>物品</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会移动物品。中间是黄金。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.8>流体</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可移动流体。中间是青金石。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.8>世界</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会把东西从地上捡起来再放回去。漏斗和投掷器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键点击运输方块并选择物品类型以安装，然后将两端指向你想要连接的对象。</grad></shadow>"
			]
