		{
			dependencies: ["6EC4740BCDB3EBEA"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>复制粘贴方块</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>纸、塑料和红石。右键单击你设置好的机器，然后右键单击该机器的其他所有副本。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能同步侧边配置和红石设置，这区别了十分钟的建造和一小时的操作。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "321292A4353571AA"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "602F6CDCA43C8133"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#C8AE86>配置一台机器，而不是三十台</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "25DFBD14CC46AE3C"
				item: "industrialforegoing:machine_settings_copier"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>机器设置复制器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 13.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["24BBE0A76CE85398"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三种塑料</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>对准任意储罐或流体方块饮用，即可获取该流体所提供的效果。 </grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>1000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 无论里面是什么，都能喝下。"
				""
				"[!warn] 它不会检查流体是否对你有益。污水是一种流体。岩浆也是一种流体。"
			]
			id: "7FE852A8906F1223"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "6020155C1C3A2BE9"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#C8AE86>直接从储罐中饮用</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "43B2C0CB76F866C0"
				item: "industrialforegoing:straw"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>稻草</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 8.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["78600F868CC3A328"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>生物燃料循环</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Industrial Foregoing 的专属能源方案是种植植物，将其粉碎成燃料，然后燃烧燃料。两台机器，其规模随你的农场扩大而扩大。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生物反应器</grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.8>将植物和水转化为生物燃料。而</grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.8>生物燃料发电机</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>则将生物燃料燃烧为能量。这就是循环过程。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 生物反应器奖励多样性，而非数量。下一个任务会解释原因，建议在建造农场前阅读。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>其他模组的能量也能正常工作。这里不关心能量来自哪里。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:biofuel_generator"
			icon_scale: 1.2d
			id: "34AB9881384FC611"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "05A15509CE5E46DE"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F2C14E to=#F2C14E>植物输入，能量输出</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "61D6D19EFE19464E"
				title: "把植物燃料给我看看"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.6>为这一切提供动力</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 14.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["34AB9881384FC611"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#B4C43A to=#E7F3A0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>九个格子</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、钻石齿轮、史莱姆球、糖、砖块和一个怜悯框架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它有九个输入槽，且不允许将同一种植物放入其中两个。每五秒，它会从每个已填充的槽中消耗一个物品，并产生等量的生物燃料水。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 填满一个格子几乎毫无意义。填满全部九个格子的价值是填满一个格子的九倍以上。参见下一个任务。"
			]
			id: "34FF3B918D7DE1F5"
			rewards: [{
				id: "1C3C523B34E96147"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B4C43A to=#B4C43A>九个格子，九种不同的植物</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7DA3A757CAAB32FE"
				item: "industrialforegoing:bioreactor"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#B4C43A to=#E7F3A0 f=0.6>生物反应器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 16.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["34FF3B918D7DE1F5"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>每周期生物燃料产量</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>产出曲线并非线性。填满一个槽位会提升其他所有槽位的价值。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>1 株植物</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 每周期产 95 个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>3 株植物</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 给予 389 个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>5 plants</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> give 827.</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>7 株植物</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 给予 1,409 个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>9 株植物</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 给予 2,135 个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>九格同一种作物，如果允许的话，能产出855。九种不同作物能产出</grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>2,135</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。物品数量相同，燃料却是两倍半。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 小麦、胡萝卜、马铃薯、甜菜根、甜瓜、南瓜、仙人掌、甘蔗和任何花。九个很容易凑齐，所以别半加载就运行。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>它消耗的水量与产生的生物燃料相等，所以离开前请先接好水源。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:wheat_seeds"
			id: "310989D7A5C6EDDA"
			min_width: 350
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "45E19CD28FC17066"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#C8AE86>九个槽位后面的数字</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "44F402B86D444B35"
				title: "行吧，那就九块农田好了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>多样性为何胜出</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 16.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["34FF3B918D7DE1F5"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>燃烧绿色植物</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、一个熔炉、两个活塞、两个金齿轮和一个Pity框架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一单位生物燃料可燃烧四刻，每秒消耗 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.8>160 能量</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，因此每单位价值 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.8>640 能量</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。满载的生物反应器每五秒可生产 2,135 单位，超过一台发电机所能消耗的量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这个整合包给了它 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.8>一百万</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的能量缓冲，并且每秒能输出高达 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.8>500 的能量，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所以它也能当你的主电池用。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 在一个生物反应器上建造两到三个发电机。反应器的产量可以轻松超过单个燃烧器。"
			]
			id: "51858753438DB8C4"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "04A77342CCC23BDE"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 20
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "5E92C77D94935D2F"
					table_id: 523655846730814564L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F2C14E to=#F2C14E>花园里，一刻钟，永远持续下去，从花园里来</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0CF2EA2EEFBCE494"
				item: "industrialforegoing:biofuel_generator"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE6A8 f=0.6>生物燃料发电机</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 18.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["51858753438DB8C4"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三台机器正对着一片田野</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Industrial Foregoing的农场不止一个方块。它是一个</grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>Sower</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、一个</grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>Gatherer</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，可选地还有一个</grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>Fertilizer</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，所有都朝向同一块泥土，且工作区域重叠。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>播种者播种，肥料加速生长，收割者收割。无需其他，永不停息。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 将三个范围附加组件设为相同，并站在能同时看到所有三个彩色框的位置。如果框不匹配，农场就有漏洞。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>采集者还会将副产品污泥填入储罐，而这些污泥竟然值点钱。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:plant_gatherer"
			icon_scale: 1.2d
			id: "34D5C5EA36E2B6B8"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "7F3C1B0DDCAC45F3"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#5DBE5D>种植、施肥、收割，重复操作</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "543FBE3495D9383E"
				title: "来种植点什么东西吧"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6>植物农场</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 20.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["34D5C5EA36E2B6B8"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>播种</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、花盆、两个活塞、两个铁齿轮、红石和一个Pity框架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>投入种子即可在周围种植。此整合包每 </grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>两秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>尝试一次，而非五次，因此能快速填满田地。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>巧妙之处在于过滤网格。每个过滤槽对应工作区的一个位置，这样你就可以种植不同作物的</grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>条带或棋盘格</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而不是一个巨大的方块。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 它也能种在水里面，这就是自动化甘蔗和海带的方法。"
			]
			id: "061618A036A1A510"
			rewards: [{
				id: "61EEA47C0BA40FDA"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#5DBE5D>它会种植，而且会按规律种植</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7CC645F2785F6A42"
				item: "industrialforegoing:plant_sower"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6>播种者植物</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 20.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["34D5C5EA36E2B6B8"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>收获作物</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、一把铁锄、一把铁斧、两个金齿轮、红石和一个Pity框架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能收割作物、砍伐树木、割取仙人掌、甘蔗、竹子、蘑菇和藤蔓。它知道每种作物的正确破坏方式，所以树木会整棵倒下，作物则会被连根拔起地收取。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次收获也会滴下 </grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>10 份污泥</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>到其储罐中。不要让储罐装满，否则机器会停止工作。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 喂食以太气体后，它会切换到收割与重植模式，这意味着播种机可以完全跳过作物种植流程。"
			]
			id: "00ECDB474FD29B35"
			rewards: [{
				id: "513D941833A407B6"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#5DBE5D>能切割一切，但会留下污泥</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0CD25CF8E0C521C5"
				item: "industrialforegoing:plant_gatherer"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6>植物采集者</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 22.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["34D5C5EA36E2B6B8"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>生长更快</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、一个玻璃瓶、皮革、两个铁齿轮、红石和一个简易框架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用骨粉或模组自带的肥料加载它，它就会每 </grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>两秒半</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>向周围喷洒一个方块。如果植物仍在生长，肥料会直接回到植物上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本整合包为喷雾器充电的电量是400的2.5倍，即1000能量，因此请使用大功率电源，而非入门级发电机。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "0E35C6619DEF0895"
			rewards: [{
				id: "195ECDC42BB08B61"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#5DBE5D>骨粉加特林机枪</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6B14410808935117"
				item: "industrialforegoing:plant_fertilizer"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6>种植肥料</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 20.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["061618A036A1A510"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>无需水泵的水源</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、一个水桶、两个活塞、两个铁齿轮、红石和一个Pity框架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用源水方块将其包围。它需要至少</grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>两个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>相邻的方块，每秒可产生</grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>100单位水</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。六个源块每周期可产600单位水。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>切断它的动力，它就会以一半的功率和五分之一的速度继续运行，所以永远不会完全停止。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 乳胶处理器、生物反应器和水培床都会持续消耗水。尽早建造其中一个。"
			]
			id: "2AFC6E897BE91B42"
			rewards: [{
				id: "045D2ECEE57A914D"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#5DBE5D>两个水方块组成一个水源</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4A7CE1898E9A78C6"
				item: "industrialforegoing:water_condensator"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6>水冷凝器</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 21.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["00ECDB474FD29B35"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>采集者的副产品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、一个桶、一个熔炉、一个铁齿轮、一个金齿轮和一个怜悯框架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将收集者的污泥储罐接入此处。每 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>500 单位污泥</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 将随机转化为以下列表中的一个方块： </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>泥土、黏土、砾石、沙子、红沙或灵魂沙</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>速度不快，也不能挑选产物，但大型树木农场能产出巨量的免费黏土和灵魂沙，简直荒谬至极。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 它还能疏通采集器，这足以成为建造它的理由。"
			]
			id: "6C5E6CDE7FA924DC"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4ED66DEF996E7971"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#D2503C to=#D2503C>从农田径流中获取免费泥土</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3A41C6A532D23C2B"
				item: "industrialforegoing:sludge_refiner"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6>污泥精炼器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 24.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0E35C6619DEF0895"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>肥料</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>与手中的骨粉和种植肥料机中的效果完全相同。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无法合成。它产自本章更靠后的、需要大量奶牛的 </grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>污水堆肥机</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 在此之前，普通的骨粉在植物肥料中就能正常使用。此物品没有任何前置条件。"
			]
			id: "1689F40C601F6B52"
