		{
			dependencies: ["4A0AAB706E019C36"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>蘑菇复制机</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、两个铁齿轮、两种任意蘑菇和一个怜悯框架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个蘑菇加上 </grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>100 水</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 会变成 </grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>两个蘑菇</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。直接翻倍，无需概率，无需催化剂。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还需要</grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>绯红木和扭曲菌丝体，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>但这些需要</grad><grad from=#5DBE5D to=#BCEDBC f=0.8>岩浆，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>而不是水在储罐里。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 将两个串联起来，就是一个无需菌丝和巨大蘑菇的指数级蘑菇农场。"
			]
			id: "65E56A8DBF540D06"
