		{
			dependencies: ["60EBF9D77DFF817B"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>色彩数学</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、四种染料、一个金齿轮和一个怜悯框架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它有三个输入槽，分别用于输入</grad><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.8>红色</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.8>绿色</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.8>蓝色</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>染料。每种染料都会为其通道增加</grad><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.8>三格电荷</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。然后选择一个输出颜色，它就会消耗该颜色所需通道的电荷。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>纯色消耗一个通道的一个电荷，所以一个红色染料会返还你</grad><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.8>三个红色染料</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。混合颜色消耗两个或三个通道。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 种植一种花，使其数量增加两倍，从此再也不用开采青金石来获取蓝色染料。"
			]
