			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6>生物屠宰场</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 39.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["012D305A15063752"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>The Inversion</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>The Slaughter Factory 会根据受害者的不同，改变击杀后获得的流体比例。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>杀死一只</grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>动物，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你将获得与其生命值相等数量的肉，以及与其生命值相等数量的粉色史莱姆，数量为生命值乘以二十。</grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>杀死一个 </grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>敌对生物，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你将获得与其生命值相等数量的肉，</grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>乘以二十，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>以及与其生命值相等的粉色史莱姆。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所以，10点血量的牛会掉落10点肉和</grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>200个粉色史莱姆</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。20点血量的僵尸会掉落</grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>400点肉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和20个粉色史莱姆。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 想要高级框架的粉色史莱姆？去刷牛。想要矿石链的液态肉？去刷生物生成器。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>一个高级框架需要500个粉色史莱姆，大约是三头牛。每个储罐容量为8000，所以把两个都接上吧。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:pink_slime_bucket"
			id: "14C706B1968AD918"
			min_width: 350
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "3CC96957C6C12E05"
