		{
			dependencies: ["01CFEC5E60F81650"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>肉肉来，怪物走开</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在溶解室中：两个泥土、两个腐肉和一个怜悯框架，浸泡在 </grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>1000 液态肉中</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"放置后，它会在自身上方生成敌对生物，持续 </grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>20 Liquid Meat</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 次。它大约每 </grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>十次循环才发射一次</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。"
				""
				"## <grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它是有规则的</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部的光照等级必须为 </grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>7 或更低</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>白天不能让它暴露在阳光下。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>最多不超过 </grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>10个生物</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在3格内，否则等待。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和平难度会将其完全关闭。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 机械泥土喂养生物破碎机是一个封闭的经验农场。机械泥土喂养屠宰场是一个封闭的肉农场。"
			]
