				"# <grad from=#FF6EC7 to=#FFC6E8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>正在固化</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在溶解室中：一个 </grad><grad from=#FF6EC7 to=#FFC6E8 f=0.8>玻璃板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放入 </grad><grad from=#FF6EC7 to=#FFC6E8 f=0.8>300 粉色史莱姆</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。十秒后你会得到一个球，并且 </grad><grad from=#FF6EC7 to=#FFC6E8 f=0.8>150 水</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 会从另一个储罐中流出。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它可以像史莱姆球一样用于合成，材料石匠厂和流体筛分机都需要它来制作配方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>该整合包还允许Biomancy将其消化成营养糊，每球四个。</grad></shadow>"
