				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在溶解室中：两个铁锭和两个金锭在 </grad><grad from=#FF6EC7 to=#FFC6E8 f=0.8>1000个粉色史莱姆中</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。十五秒内完成。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你需要这些来建造 </grad><grad from=#FF6EC7 to=#FFC6E8 f=0.8>洗衣工厂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，它是矿石增殖链的入口。</grad></shadow>"
