				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、下界疣、两份岩浆膏、两份绿宝石、红石和一个 </grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将装有物品的</grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>Mob Imprisonment Tool</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>加载，并用</grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>essence</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>填充储罐，它便会在周围生成副本。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"## <grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>代价</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次生成的精华等于生物的生命值 </grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>乘以十二</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。僵尸是240，烈焰人是240，凋零骷髅是240。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>根据已储存的精华数量，每次会生成 </grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>一到四个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>如果区域内已有超过32个该生物，则会停止生成。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 本整合包每次操作消耗5000能量，而非模组的400。费用高出十二倍。请使用真正的电源线。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>整个整合包已关闭完全复制模式，因此复制品会作为新生物生成，而非你捕获生物的完美副本。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "1DBDD931A09D154E"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "03B3E5873CD3D03D"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 25
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "0C28B12CEC3AE210"
					table_id: 3488080005486828330L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#A85A46 to=#A85A46>精华输入，复制输出</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6FA55A4E1F69F3BF"
				item: "industrialforegoing:mob_duplicator"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.6>生物复制器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 46.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1DBDD931A09D154E"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>无法移动</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>三个灵魂沙、两个恶魂之泪、两个金齿轮、一个活塞和一个</grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>范围内的所有生物都会停止行动。它们不会寻路、不会攻击、也不会消失，并且会缓慢恢复生命值。在本整合包中，它还</grad><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.8>隐藏了它们的boss血条</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，这使得一个充满被定住的boss的房间也能正常使用。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 区域内的玩家会受到强烈的迟缓效果，完全无法移动。请勿将工作区建在您的走道上。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>标准方法是使用Stasis Chamber困住复制的Boss，同时用Mob Crusher处理它。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "18332B6D44CFBDF1"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "07523E503BA6200D"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 20
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "0A8C144720A23DE4"
					table_id: 523655846730814564L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#A85A46 to=#A85A46>冻结一切，包括你自己</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "51E09CE845167996"
				item: "industrialforegoing:stasis_chamber"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#A85A46 to=#E3A794 f=0.6>静止舱</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 46.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1DBDD931A09D154E"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>液体高度</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>精华是将经验转化为流体。该模组中兑换率固定不变：</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>每经验点20精华</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"## <grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>来源说明</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>经验模式下，每击杀一个生物，都会获得经验的 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>Mob Crusher</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>下水道</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>，会对其区域内落下的球体和站在其中的玩家造成伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>资源丰富的熔炉</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>，来自每次冶炼所获得的经验值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>从装备上移除附魔的 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>附魔提取器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 溶解室能将250点精华在四分之一秒内转化为经验瓶，无需其他材料。这就是你的银行。"
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:essence_bucket"
			icon_scale: 1.2d
			id: "5150902A2FB229B8"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "4326D8FA0D08049E"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#8FE33F to=#8FE33F>经验值，但可以将其导入管道</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "70F67F445D4FC6CF"
				item: "industrialforegoing:essence_bucket"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.6>精粹</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 48.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5150902A2FB229B8"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>移除附魔</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、下界砖、一本书、两颗钻石、一个金齿轮和一个 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>精华模式</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会剥离整个物品，并以精华的形式返还你附魔的经验值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>书籍模式</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要在第二栏放置一本空白书，并将物品上的</grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>一个附魔一次</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>转移到该书上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>书籍模式能将附魔了五种效果的剑分解成五本纯净的书籍，这样你就能打造出自己想要的精准装备了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 如果物品上的所有附魔都是诅咒，那么该物品将原封不动地返还。"
			]
			id: "61D98DA7A967DCF5"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "61C1C577E8914240"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 20
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "7209377C37890EB4"
					table_id: 523655846730814564L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#8FE33F to=#8FE33F>两种模式，都很有用</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "55EAB4E13998CCEB"
				item: "industrialforegoing:enchantment_extractor"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.6>附魔提取器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 49.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["61D98DA7A967DCF5"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>分类整理</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、一颗末影珍珠、一本书、一本附魔书、一个钻石齿轮和一个 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个输入，两个输出。带有附魔的物品从一侧输出，其余物品从另一侧输出。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 将 Mob Crusher 的输出指向这里，就再也不用在腐肉堆里挖掘附魔的怪物掉落物了。"
			]
			id: "2BFF89CE5D0BB790"
			rewards: [{
