			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.6>激光钻孔</grad></shadow>"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 48.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4232D49AF4A069B3"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>发射器</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、一个钻石齿轮、两个黄金齿轮、两个活塞、红石和一个 </grad><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.8>简易框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>单独使用时它什么也不做。它会找到前方的激光基地，每消耗1000能量，就为该基地推进一次进度，间隔时间为</grad><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.8>两秒半</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 四台钻机，四倍矿石。用尽可能多的钻机环绕基地，并将钻机数量视为吞吐量调节器。"
			]
			id: "659DE9155E30B508"
			rewards: [{
				id: "48F0784D4367BE1C"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 20
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FF5A3C>建造六个，而不是一个</grad>"
