			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.6>矿石激光基地</grad></shadow>"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 50.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["659DE9155E30B508"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>操纵骰子</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"每种染料需要一个透镜，全部在 </grad><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.8>Dissolution Chamber</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 中制作。你也可以在合成台用染料重新染色现有透镜，这比制作新的快得多。"
				""
				"将透镜放入激光底座会为其关联的所有矿石增加8点重量。放入多个透镜即可同时偏重多个矿石。"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>值得拥有的那些人</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.8>白色</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>偏爱石英、铱和谢尔顿石。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.8>黄色</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>偏爱金、萤石、硫磺和硝石。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.8>紫色</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>偏爱德拉科尼乌姆、方铅矿和铅。它也是以太气体透镜。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.8>红色</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>偏向红石、红宝石、朱砂和四方辉矿。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.8>浅蓝色</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>偏爱钻石和铂金。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF5A3C to=#FFB9A8 f=0.8>绿色</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>偏向于绿宝石和铀。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 透镜会影响概率，不会锁定结果。你仍然会获得池子里的所有东西，只是频率较低。"
			]
