		{
			dependencies: ["7B2C04B4509CA8FC"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>深度带</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>下方的重量才是好的，位于矿石带内。带外的大多数矿石重量会降到1或2。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>红石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 重量 28，Y 坐标 5 到 16。游戏中单个最重的物品。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>铁</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 重量 20，从 Y 5 到 68。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>金</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 重量 16，Y 坐标 32 到 80 之间。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Lapis</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> weight 14, from Y 13 to 34.</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>石英</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 重量 12，Y 坐标 7 到 117 之间。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>煤炭和铜矿，重量10，宽条带。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Emerald</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> weight 8, from Y 5 to 29.</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>钻石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 重量 4，Y 坐标 5 到 16 之间。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>远古残骸</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 权重 1，Y 坐标 1 到 20 之间，且在该范围外完全不会出现。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] Y 10左右是最佳位置。它同时位于红石、钻石、绿宝石、铁和远古残骸的富集带内。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>本整合包的模组矿石遵循同一系统。Draconium位于Y 60至95的高处，Fluorite和Galena位于Y 15至30的低处，Tin和Aluminium则靠近地表。</grad></shadow>"
			]
