		{
			dependencies: ["3B637D574E6E313C"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>终局流体</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>以太气体的来源只有一个，那就是用激光折磨凋灵。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"## <grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它能为你带来什么</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>至尊机械框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>各需135个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要 </grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>菌丝反应堆</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 500个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无限核弹需要 2,000 个。</grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>最佳模式下，</grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>发酵站</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每消耗100块矿石肉可燃烧1次。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>水培床</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>植物收集器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在上面运行得更好。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 正确的建造方式是：用 Wither Builder 制造，用 Stasis Chamber 固定并治疗，再用激光钻头环绕。这就是这两种机器存在的意义。"
			]
