			tasks: [{
				id: "21DA4153F7D5CCF5"
				item: "industrialforegoing:material_stonework_factory"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#AFC3D8 to=#E6EFF8 f=0.6>材料石材加工厂</grad></shadow>"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 50.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["57AC46EBF68C3ED5"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>酿造</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、一个酿造台、两个中继器、三个金齿轮和一个 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>给它水和玻璃瓶，它就会一次制作出 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>三瓶水瓶，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>然后用你提供的材料完成六个酿造阶段。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>烈焰粉只需一格，每格可酿造 </grad><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.8>20瓶药水</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，比一整堆真正的酿造台所需的烈焰粉少得多。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "744F5E082D7B1C4E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "317C622AB0B72275"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#8FE33F to=#8FE33F>一格放置六个酿造台</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "226D550E45695C52"
				item: "industrialforegoing:potion_brewer"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8FE33F to=#D8FFA8 f=0.6>药水酿造师</grad></shadow>"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 52.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B637D574E6E313C"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三台机器，五倍矿石</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Industrial Foregoing 将矿石翻倍的方法，是将矿石溶解在肉中，发酵肉，然后再将粉尘筛出来。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>洗矿厂</grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>将1个矿石和100个液态肉转化为100个生肉矿石。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>发酵站会密封并最多将气体扩大五倍。</grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>流体筛分机</grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>会将每100个沙子加1个沙子转化为1个粉尘。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>算一算，一块原矿能变成 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>五种粉尘</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，熔炼后能得到五个锭。本模组中别无他物能与之媲美。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 适用于游戏视为矿石或原材料的任何物品，包括本整合包中的模组金属。"
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:fermented_ore_meat_bucket"
			icon_scale: 1.2d
			id: "6D317ECE930B0DE0"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [{
				id: "7EF7750DF075ED83"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 20
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#D2503C to=#D2503C>模组中最奇怪的矿石链</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "021B21AFD9754BAB"
				title: "肉。换矿石。行吧。"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6>一矿石，五粉尘</grad></shadow>"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 54.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6D317ECE930B0DE0"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>第一步</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两个粉色史莱姆锭、塑料、一个喂食器、一个钻石齿轮、一个熔炉和一个 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一种矿石物品加上 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>100 液态肉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 会变成 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>100 原始矿石肉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并且流体会记住它来自哪种矿石。五秒前完成。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 这就是让整个牛牧场都值得建造的机器。液态肉是输入，而敌对生物提供的液态肉是动物的二十倍。"
			]
			id: "2339A02523BACA60"
			rewards: [{
				id: "02FB073E87311F29"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 20
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#D2503C to=#D2503C>矿石投入，矿汤产出</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "32B01728A96C825D"
				item: "industrialforegoing:washing_factory"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6>洗衣工厂</grad></shadow>"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 54.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6D317ECE930B0DE0"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>第二步</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、四根原木、一个金齿轮和一个 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>简易框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。这绝对是整条生产线里最便宜的机器了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用生矿石肉填满，密封并等待。放置越久，产出的越多，而且前两种设置需要催化剂流体。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>2x</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 后 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>5 秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。无需催化剂。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>3x</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 后 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>45 秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。无需催化剂。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>4x</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 2分钟后 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>2分钟</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。每100消耗2个粉色史莱姆。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>5x</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 后 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>5 分钟</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。每 100 消耗 1 单位以太气体。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你还可以选择密封前需要填充的程度：完全充满、半满，或是只需1000格燃料即可密封。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 密封即密封。发酵期间无法再倒入更多，因此请根据洗衣机的运行速度来设置储罐的大小。"
			]
