		{
			dependencies: ["6D317ECE930B0DE0"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>第三步</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>塑料、一个粉色史莱姆球、三根铁锭、两个金齿轮和一个 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 份生或发酵的矿石肉，外加 </grad><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.8>一份沙子</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，可获得一份用于洗矿机的矿石粉尘。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 沙子是唯一消耗品，而污泥精炼器能免费用农场的废水制造沙子。这样循环就闭合了。"
			]
			id: "76D91D598AAC7C15"
			rewards: [{
				id: "49F7A53D01994843"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 20
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#D2503C to=#D2503C>沙子，你就能拿回矿石了</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "08B34F8E663040F5"
				item: "industrialforegoing:fluid_sieving_machine"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#D2503C to=#F5A99B f=0.6>流体筛分机</grad></shadow>"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 54.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6E23B8CDA050BED9"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>一块生铁，从头到尾</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>洗矿机：1 个粗铁加 100 液态肉可产出 </grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>100 个原矿肉块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>5x发酵器：投入100个，产出</grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>500个发酵矿石肉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，消耗5个以太气体。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>筛子：500 除以 100 得到 </grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>5 铁粉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并消耗 5 个沙子。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>熔炉：5 个粉尘可炼成 </grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>5 个铁锭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 在3倍速下，完全不需要催化剂，同种矿石就能产出3个锭，只需等待45秒。这本身就比本整合包里大多数矿石翻倍的效果要好。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>矿石激光基地负责生产矿石，所以从这里开始，你就是在用能量和牛来生产金属了。</grad></shadow>"
			]
