		{
			dependencies: ["6EBB2616D5C6267E"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>第三级</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"在溶解室中：两个塑料、一个 </grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>两个下界合金锭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、两颗钻石和一个 </grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>钻石齿轮</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，浸泡在 </grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>135 份以太气体</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>只有四样东西符合要求，而且都是顶尖的： </grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>黑洞控制器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、 </grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>凋零建造器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、 </grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#D9C8FF f=0.8>菌丝反应堆</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和至尊存储方块。"
				""
				"[!tip] 135 份以太气体约等于十四次激光填充，相当于一个凋零损失 70 点生命。请据此规划预算。"
			]
