		{
			dependencies: ["4D99E4B5DE7213D7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C6BAFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>物品存储</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"最常见的是铁锭、木箱、一个铁齿轮和一个怜悯框架。之后的每个等级都是塑料、末影珍珠、末影之眼、一个木箱和对应的框架。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>各等级的容量（物品数）：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C6BAFF f=0.8>普通</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 可容纳 2,048 个物品。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C6BAFF f=0.8>Pity</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 持有 16,384 个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C6BAFF f=0.8>简易的</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可容纳 524,288 个物品。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C6BAFF f=0.8>高级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 可容纳 67,108,864 个物品。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C6BAFF f=0.8>至高的</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>持有 2,147,483,647 个物品。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 两种常用单位也是Infinity Backpack的配方材料，所以多做一些便宜的备用。"
			]
