		{
			dependencies: ["09400320948EE469"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FFCE3D to=#FFEEB0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>七件物品，一个创意</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所有Infinity物品都依靠</grad><grad from=#FFCE3D to=#FFEEB0 f=0.8>储存的能量</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>运行，其内部能量多少决定了当前的强度。填满后会自动升级。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它们都是在</grad><grad from=#FFCE3D to=#FFEEB0 f=0.8>Dissolution Chamber</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>里用</grad><grad from=#FFCE3D to=#FFEEB0 f=0.8>2,000 pink slime</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>制作的，除了核弹需要ether gas，而且每个都需要</grad><grad from=#FFCE3D to=#FFEEB0 f=0.8>biggest range addon</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>作为材料。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键单击任意一个并按住 Shift 键，即可打开其专属界面，选择运行等级，从而降低消耗以节省电量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 先建造无限充电器。手动充电太痛苦了。"
			]
