			description: [
				"# <grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>食物被烧毁</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八种作物环绕着烤牛排，置于一个</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>简易框架上</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>任何食物都行，两个数值都随食物本身缩放。燃烧时间为</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>营养值乘以160</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，功率为</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>饱腹度乘以80</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>金胡萝卜和烤牛排都很棒。饼干就不行了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 将植物采集器对准南瓜农场，你就能从同一块地里获得无限的食物和无限的电力。"
			]
