				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一种粉色染料会燃烧整整 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>69 个游戏刻</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，燃烧速度为每刻 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>135 点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。有人是故意选这些数字的。</grad></shadow>"
