				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八个红石块围绕一个岩浆桶，放置在一个</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>高级框架上</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会喝下 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>250 岩浆，持续 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>500 游戏刻，每秒消耗 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>50 点岩浆。将 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>红石粉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放在侧边栏位，消耗速度将翻倍至每秒 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>100 点岩浆。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
