				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>TNT</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 燃烧 3,200 次，价值 160。价值 512,000，非 Supreme 套装中最优者。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>火药</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在160度下燃烧400刻。价值64,000。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 八个火药和一个沙子能合成TNT，所以用苦力怕农场来提供原料比直接喂火药好八倍。"
			]
			id: "6EDAB7FB4FABC4C9"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2D5B56E3B1B669B9"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#4FD9CE>TNT，安全地，装在箱子里</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "508FAE5FB5F51DB7"
				item: "industrialforegoing:mycelial_explosive"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6>爆炸物发生器</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.5d
			y: 51.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["77033769DDD9966C"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>燃烧的药水</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>酿造台周围环绕着八个下界疣，放置于一个 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"燃烧时间是药水效果的持续时间，强度取决于放大器。一瓶长效的虚弱药水远比一瓶溅射药水更有价值。它会返还空瓶。"
				""
				"[!tip] 本章稍后的任务会讲到酿造台。这两者简直是天生一对。"
			]
			id: "5386C5F938E054F8"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3DD264B2AF7D5A8E"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#4FD9CE>更强的药水，更强大的力量</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4BC2971A166EB6A9"
				item: "industrialforegoing:mycelial_potion"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6>药水生成器</grad></shadow>"
			x: -8.0d
			y: 49.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["769589DBB89DE5F1"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>燃烧附魔书</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>磨石周围有八本书，放在一个 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用附魔书喂养它。燃烧时间取决于附魔的</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>稀有度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而火焰强度取决于附魔的</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>等级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每级160。之后它会返还普通的书。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 将附魔分类器对准生物破碎机，将附魔物品直接导入此处。从垃圾掉落物中获取免费能量。"
			]
			id: "11EBFA6115AF864E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "6246DD1309ED706A"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#4FD9CE>烧毁你的劣质战利品</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "77D66A03CC9BD98E"
				item: "industrialforegoing:mycelial_disenchantment"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6>附魔分解器</grad></shadow>"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 49.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4240B012080A31AA"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>焚烧亡者</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一块骨头周围环绕着八块腐肉，放置在一个</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>高级框架上</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"腐肉、骨头、骨块和凋零骷髅头都会燃烧200刻，每刻20点，总计4000点，不算多。"
				""
				"[!info] 它的主要用途是让僵尸农场腐肉山有去处，同时也能完成反应堆的成就。"
			]
			id: "5036A9116E9971EB"
			rewards: [{
				id: "30FB542BE6815B68"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "square"
