		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6EDAB7FB4FABC4C9"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>燃烧的烟花</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八个火药围绕纸张，置于一个 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>燃烧时间取决于烟花的 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>爆炸威力</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每点80，而其 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>飞行时长</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 每点贡献60。三火药加大型星形助推器是最佳选择。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>没有星星的普通火箭什么也给不了，所以得往里面放点东西。</grad></shadow>"
			]
