				"# <grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>燃烧下界植物</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八个下界菌块环绕着一个绯红菌，放置在一个</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>高级框架上</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>真菌、根、藤蔓和嫩芽</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 在20处燃烧200刻。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>Shroomlight</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 燃烧 200 刻，温度 40。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>下界砖块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 在40处燃烧400刻。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 在扭曲森林的地板上放置植物采集器，既能提供食物，又能同时获得用于水培床的菌类。"
			]
