		{
			dependencies: ["11EBFA6115AF864E"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>燃烧的龙之息</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八个紫晶块围绕一根末地柱，置于一个 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>至尊框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一瓶</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>龙之息</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>燃烧时间为</grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>12,000 ticks</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，即现实中的十分钟，每 tick 40。每瓶燃烧时间为 480,000 次。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 龙之息意味着一条龙。这被称为终极级生成器是有原因的。"
			]
