		{
			dependencies: ["5036A9116E9971EB"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>灼烧肉类与金属</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>任意物品的八个锭围绕一个液态肉桶，置于一个 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>至尊框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>250 液态肉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 加上 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>一锭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 任意金属锭，运行 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>400 游戏刻，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 速度为 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>每刻 200 次，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 每锭 80,000 次。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 本章早些时候的矿石链能将一个矿石变成五个锭。把多余的喂给它们，奶牛们简直是在为电网付费。"
			]
