		{
			dependencies: ["6221AF28F4141FD1"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>燃烧的下界之星</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八个凋零骷髅头环绕着一颗下界之星，放置于一个 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>至尊框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一颗下界之星能燃烧 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>2,400 次，每次产生 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>4,000 能量，总计 </grad><grad from=#4FD9CE to=#BFF5F0 f=0.8>9,600,000 能量，比套装中任何其他物品每秒强二十五倍。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] Wither Builder 会循环生成凋灵，Mob Crusher 会收集星星。这就是一个下界之星农场，也是设计用途。"
			]
