		{
			dependencies: ["225A935B6EB6919C"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>你最终落脚的地方</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你最初用泵敲打了一棵树。现在你正站在一个由十六个并行运行的笑话生成器驱动的核反应堆旁，每秒能产生两千五百万的能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>树能制造 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>乳胶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，乳胶能制造 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>塑料</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而塑料能制造一切。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>牛能制造 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>粉色史莱姆</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，粉色史莱姆能制造 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>高级框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>凋零会生成 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>以太气体</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，以太气体会生成 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>至尊框架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>矿石加肉加时间，产出的是 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>五倍的矿石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>十六个发电机组成一个反应堆，反应堆可制作 </grad><grad from=#E8A33D to=#FFDCA8 f=0.8>Artifact 级装备</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 矿石激光基地和矿石链意味着你再也不需要挖矿。无限背包意味着你再也不需要整理物品。快去建造点疯狂的东西吧。"
			]
